 "result": "Call order (all in `src/tessel/`):\n\n1. `Tessel.__call__` → `Tessel.wsgi_entry` (`app.py:1618`, `app.py:1566`): the WSGI entry point.\n2. `Tessel.run_full_request` (`app.py:992`): dispatches the view, then calls `finalize_request` at line 1019. On an unhandled error, `route_unhandled_fault` (`app.py:897`) calls `finalize_request` instead (line 948).\n3. `Tessel.finalize_request` (`app.py:1021`): turns the return value into a response and passes it to `finalize_reply`. I didn't read this function, so that link is inferred from the names and line numbers.\n4. `Tessel.finalize_reply` (`app.py:1394`): runs the after-request hooks. Then, if the session isn't null, it calls `session_interface.persist_session(...)` (`app.py:1415-1416`).\n5. `SignedCookieSessionInterface.persist_session` (`sessions.py:337`): calls `response.delete_cookie(...)` at line 356 when the session is empty. Otherwise it calls `response.set_cookie(...)` at line 374, which writes the signed cookie.\n\nThe default interface is set at `app.py:250`. The base-class `persist_session` is at `sessions.py:263`.",
